7.0.0.1, localhost or ::1, start and pull nothing. That server is the operator's, so end with STATUS=FAIL naming the URL and the install guide's start and pull commands.` Verify: before the change the case fails, after it `NT $SARC` reports `fail 0`.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-report.md:\n  Line 181: | DR2-P2-002 | P2 | CONFIRMED | `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml:89` | introduced | Run `ollama serve` and `ollama pull` with `OLLAMA_HOST` taken from the resolved URL. Otherwise refuse start and pull for a non-local URL |\n\n  Line 302: - **DR2-P2-002** The probe step reads `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` (`:89`) while the start and pull steps (`:125-126`) bind no host. Test: a contract assertion that both mutating steps name `OLLAMA_HOST` from the resolved URL fails today.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install/iterations/iteration-002.md:\n  Line 38: 2. **The embedder route probes OLLAMA_BASE_URL but starts and pulls against the default local host** -- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml:89` -- phase 1 resolves the server URL from `OLLAMA_BASE_URL` (default `http://127.0.0.1:11434`), while phase 4 starts `ollama serve` (`:125`) and runs `ollama pull` (`:126`) without carrying that URL through `OLLAMA_HOST`. With a non-default base URL the plan is computed for one server and the approved mutation runs against another.\n\n  Line 41:    - Scope proof: `rg -n \"OLLAMA_BASE_URL|OLLAMA_HOST|ollama serve|ollama pull\"` in the embedder YAML shows the env read only at `:89` and no host binding on the two mutating commands.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scorin