{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794558879636,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf6571fffehC4jAi27gzqHQX","part":{"partID":"prt_1d40b61b3001147jupxCNH4RXz","sessionID":"ses_e2bf6571fffehC4jAi27gzqHQX","messageID":"msg_1d40b46f7001TPtET2a6XbPopf","type":"tool","id":"call_00_sUWusROPoiDSb4vEfIkl3759","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml","oldString":"      - \"When the start step is missing, run `ollama serve` in the background with a readable log, record the pid this run started and poll `/api/version` until it answers or a short deadline passes. A server that never answers is STATUS=FAIL naming the start and the log path, and the pull and scan steps do not run.\"\n      - \"When the pull step is missing, run `ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5` only once the server answers. A non-zero exit is STATUS=FAIL naming the pull, and the scan step does not run.\"","newString":"      - \"When the resolved URL's host is not 127.0.0.1, localhost or ::1, start and pull nothing. That server is the operator's, so end with STATUS=FAIL naming the URL and the install guide's start and pull commands.\"\n      - \"When the start step is missing, run `OLLAMA_HOST=<host:port of the resolved URL> ollama serve` in the background with a readable log, record the pid this run started and poll `/api/version` until it answers or a short deadline passes. A server that never answers is STATUS=FAIL naming the start and the log path, and the pull and scan steps do not run.\"\n      - \"When the pull step is missing, run `OLLAMA_HOST=<host:port of the resolved URL> ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5` only once the server answers. A non-zero exit is STATUS=FAIL naming the pull, and the scan step does not run.\""},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\n+++ .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\n@@ -121,10 +121,11 @@\n     purpose: \"Run only the steps the approved plan listed, in dependency order\"\n     runs_when: \"phase_3_approval approved\"\n     activities:\n       - \"When the install step is missing, print the Ollama install command the install guide prints and stop with STATUS=FAIL, naming that command as the next step. Never install or upgrade Ollama from this route.\"\n-      - \"When the start step is missing, run `ollama serve` in the background with a readable log, record the pid this run started and poll `/api/version` until it answers or a short deadline passes. A server that never answers is STATUS=FAIL naming the start and the log path, and the pull and scan steps do not run.\"\n-      - \"When the pull step is missing, run `ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5` only once the server answers. A non-zero exit is STATUS=FAIL naming the pull, and the scan step does not run.\"\n+      - \"When the resolved URL's host is not 127.0.0.1, localhost or ::1, start and pull nothing. That server is the operator's, so end with STATUS=FAIL naming the URL and the install guide's start and pull commands.\"\n+      - \"When the start step is missing, run `OLLAMA_HOST=<host:port of the resolved URL> ollama serve` in the background with a readable log, record the pid this run started and poll `/api/version` until it answers or a short deadline passes. A server that never answers is STATUS=FAIL naming the start and the log path, and the pull and scan steps do not run.\"\n+      - \"When the pull step is missing, run `OLLAMA_HOST=<host:port of the resolved URL> ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5` only once the server answers. A non-zero exit is STATUS=FAIL naming the pull, and the scan step does not run.\"\n       - \"Never pull a model the plan did not list, never remove a model and never restart a server this run did not start.\"\n \n   phase_5_scan:\n     purpose: \"Write the command vectors the scan owns\"\n","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\", \"oldString\": \"      - \\\"When the start step is missing, run `ollama serve` in the background with a readable log, record the pid this run started and poll `/api/version` until it answers or a short deadline passes. A server that never answers is STATUS=FAIL naming the start and the log path, and the pull and scan steps do not run.\\\"\\n      - \\\"When the pull step is missing, run `ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5` only once the server answers. A non-zero exit is STATUS=FAIL naming the pull, and the scan step does not run.\\\"\", \"newString\": \"      - \\\"When the resolved URL's host is not 127.0.0.1, localhost or ::1, start and pull nothing. That server is the operator's, so end with STATUS=FAIL naming the URL and the install guide's start and pull commands.\\\"\\n      - \\\"When the start step is missing, run `OLLAMA_HOST=<host:port of the resolved URL> ollama serve` in the background with a readable log, record the pid this run started and poll `/api/version` until it answers or a short deadline passes. A server that never answers is STATUS=FAIL naming the start and the log path, and the pull and scan steps do not run.\\\"\\n      - \\\"When the pull step is missing, run `OLLAMA_HOST=<host:port of the resolved URL> ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5` only once the server answers. A non-zero exit is STATUS=FAIL naming the pull, and the scan step does not run.\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794558878131,"end":1794558879636}}}}
