{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794558884118,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf6571fffehC4jAi27gzqHQX","part":{"partID":"prt_1d40b764b001agDhf0TWrXxrS0","sessionID":"ses_e2bf6571fffehC4jAi27gzqHQX","messageID":"msg_1d40b6d39001HOUzwPl1kfceBK","type":"tool","id":"call_00_ET_Vunhvh0FZ2HCDMICsyhq7609","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/skill-advisor-route-contract.test.cjs 2>&1 | tail -20"},"output":"✔ every advisor command declared on the skill-advisor route exists in the live registry (subset, not equality) (14.829167ms)\n✔ the registry reader ignores name fields outside the exported tool list (0.5245ms)\n✔ the researched high-value command subset is declared on the skill-advisor route, including skill_graph_validate (6.707583ms)\n✔ each declared invocation keeps the flags its command needs (6.914ms)\n✔ the doctor command docs and workflow assets reach the advisor through the CLI and name no advisor MCP tool id (43.169458ms)\n✔ the allowed-tools reader finds the first listed tool and the YAML list form (0.318833ms)\n✔ the route does not silently claim full-registry equality — this stays a documented subset (17.007416ms)\n✔ the embedder setup route is in the manifest with its own workflow asset and dry run (11.269334ms)\n✔ the embedder workflow stops at one approval before any pull, server start or scan (11.969583ms)\n✔ the embedder start and pull steps bind the resolved host and refuse a remote one (12.882584ms)\n✔ a dry run stops after the plan with STATUS=OK and changes nothing (9.655416ms)\n✔ no embedder step installs Ollama, which the route only prints for the operator (7.707667ms)\nℹ tests 12\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 12\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 204.421667\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"✔ ever