{"type":"text","timestamp":1794558936547,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf6571fffehC4jAi27gzqHQX","part":{"id":"prt_1d40c3ad90023o7icipiMJBKsh","sessionID":"ses_e2bf6571fffehC4jAi27gzqHQX","messageID":"msg_1d40c213d0015uD53o6GTJ0MA0","type":"text","text":"T039 is complete and the verify command passes. I added the contract case first, saw it fail, then changed the workflow asset and saw it pass.\n\nFiles written:\n\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/skill-advisor-route-contract.test.cjs` adds the case `the embedder start and pull steps bind the resolved host and refuse a remote one`. It requires a phase 4 refusal activity naming the non-local hosts, `start and pull nothing` and `STATUS=FAIL naming the URL`, and requires the `ollama serve` and `ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5` activities to come after it and to bind `OLLAMA_HOST=` from the resolved URL.\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml` adds the refusal activity before the start and pull steps, changes the start step to `OLLAMA_HOST=<host:port of the resolved URL> ollama serve` and the pull step to `OLLAMA_HOST=<host:port of the resolved URL> ollama pull nomic-embed-text:v1.5`.\n\nBefore the change, `node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/skill-advisor-route-contract.test.cjs` reported `tests 12`, `pass 11`, `fail 1`, failing on `the approved steps must refuse a resolved URL whose host is not local`.\n\nVerify output after the change:\n\n```\n✔ the embedder start and pull steps bind the resolved host and refuse a remote one (8.872958ms)\nℹ tests 12\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 12\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nverify exit=0\n```\n\n`node --check` on the test file exits 0. `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff` shows only the two named files, the tasks.md checkbox is untouched, and no temporary files were created.\n\nOne note, not fixed because the task named only the start and pull steps: the phase 2 plan cost row still describes the start generically as `ollama serve` without the host binding. Nothing is blocked on you.","time":{"start":1794558933721,"end":1794558936547}}}
